  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Node tag = mistake risk, not code quality",
      "items": [
        "deterministic: code logic — bugs possible, judgment-call errors are not",
        "model, gated: a model proposes, a deterministic check or an independent reviewer catches disagreement before it has effect",
        "model, ungated: a model's output is trusted directly — the 4 probes are the only such nodes, and their output only ever produces questions or context, never a direct effect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Trust zones (LLD §3)",
      "items": [
        "Operator-approved: controller, config, grants",
        "Immutable evidence: store, verify results, candidates",
        "Untrusted: worker output, retrieved content, external events",
        "No model writes the ledger, credentials, or policy directly"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Conditional, not exhaustive",
      "items": [
        "Ambiguity probes run only when the IntentSpec has real unknowns",
        "At most 3 deduped questions asked per interaction",
        "dag -> ready skips planning entirely at risk tier low (dashed edge above)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Safety invariants",
      "items": [
        "Builder AND reviewer must each be independently qualified — same cohort bar, applied twice",
        "Rollback resets a private ref only if HEAD is unchanged, else compensating revert",
        "Self-optimizer perturbs numeric knobs only; a new prompt version is human-authored, never autonomous"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Not drawn as nodes here (see LLD.md)",
      "items": [
        "Quota failover: route re-checks the model catalog and reroutes on exhaustion (§16) — a runtime retry concern, not a pipeline stage",
